      en: ["Yardenit was officially opened as a baptismal site in 1981.", "Approximately 500,000 visitors pass through the site each year.", "The 'Wall of New Life' features biblical verses in over 80 languages.", "The site is owned and operated by the local Kibbutz Kinneret.", "It is located exactly where the Jordan River flows out of the Sea of Galilee.", "Baptismal robes can be rented or purchased at the visitor center."],
